{"id": "EUVD-2026-97885", "enisaUuid": "5dc7b33e-64aa-3378-9d84-b7ee7daab66d", "description": "SnapOtter 1.15.10 through 2.2.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated principal to call the /api/v1/upload, /api/v1/preview and /api/v1/preview/generate handlers without permission checks. Attackers holding even a settings:read-scoped API key can stage arbitrary files outside storage quota, served unauthenticated via /api/v1/download, and feed crafted input to image and video decoders.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T20:55:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T13:53:59", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/snapotter-hq/SnapOtter/commit/1544966b52b8f2b40ef3794e43ffd4f0214550ba", "https://github.com/snapotter-hq/SnapOtter/blob/v2.2.0/apps/api/src/routes/files.ts", "https://github.com/snapotter-hq/SnapOtter", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/snapotter-1.15.10-through-2.2.0-missing-authorization-via-upload-and-preview-api"], "aliases": ["GHSA-j3v8-3vrc-7ghh", "CVE-2026-109562"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "e2f9a8a7-cc28-3a61-be28-7b4521740f08", "product": {"name": "SnapOtter", "vendor": {"name": "snapotter-hq"}}, "product_version": "1.15.10 \u22642.2.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f415f15b-7577-318e-adf1-80b684b61f00", "vendor": {"name": "snapotter-hq"}}], "isExploited": false}